    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Linked list</span><span class=\"chip accent\">In-place reversal</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/reverse-nodes-in-k-group/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 25</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Reverse Nodes in k-Group</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Probe k nodes ahead first; only a full group is reversed. Reverse it with the standard three-pointer loop, but start <code>prev</code> at the node after the group so the new tail is already linked; then hook the previous group's tail to the new head. O(n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
